          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can I bake with Fruity Pebbles protein powder?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. It works in pancakes, muffins, mug cakes, yogurt bowls and no-bake bites. Because whey isolate dries out quickly, replace only part of the flour, add extra liquid or yogurt, and shorten the bake slightly. Heat can mute the flavor and change the texture, but cooking does not reduce the protein's nutritional value in any way that matters."
          }
        },
