          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What tastes most like Fruity Pebbles if I cannot find it?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The closest current alternative is Ghost Whey Trix Cereal Milk, launched with General Mills in March 2026, which lists 25 g of protein per scoop. Optimum Nutrition has released a limited-edition Gold Standard Fruity Cereal flavor with 24 g of protein, but availability varies. ISO100 Pebbles Birthday Cake is another option with the same macros as Fruity Pebbles."
