            The mass gainer is harder to compare because most of what you are buying is carbohydrate. A 6 lb bag holds only about eight 333 g servings, so even a modest price per bag translates to several dollars per serving. If your goal is calories, that may be fine. If your goal is protein, the gainer is the most expensive way on this page to buy 25 g of it.
