              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Super Mass Gainer Fruity Pebbles and ISO100 Fruity Pebbles share a flavor and a logo but not a purpose. The gainer delivers about 1,280 calories per serving against roughly 120 for ISO100. Check the product name and serving size before you order, especially on mobile listings where the titles get cut off.
