              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Dymatize describes ISO100 as banned-substance tested, but certification databases list specific products and flavors, not whole brands. If you are a drug-tested athlete, search the exact Pebbles flavor in the certifier's database before you rely on it. A certificate for one ISO100 flavor does not automatically cover every tub.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
