              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Dymatize is transitioning the formula away from Red No. 3, so an older listing photo may show a different ingredient list from the tub that ships. If a specific color or ingredient matters to you, read the label on the product you receive and buy from sellers that turn stock quickly.
              </p>
            </div>
