              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                The 5 lb tub is the best value per scoop, but only if you like the flavor. Fruity Pebbles is sweet and distinctive, and some people tire of it within a few weeks. Buy the 20-serving size first, then move up once you know you will finish the larger tub.
