              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Pure Protein sells Fruity Pebbles bars with about 20 g of protein each, and they often appear in the same search results as the powder. Bars carry more calories and are a different product from a different company. If you want the 25 g, low-sugar shake, look for Dymatize ISO100 specifically.
              </p>
