            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What tastes most like Fruity Pebbles if I cannot find it?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                The closest current alternative is Ghost Whey Trix Cereal Milk, launched with General Mills in March 2026, which lists 25 g of protein per scoop. Optimum Nutrition has released a limited-edition Gold Standard Fruity Cereal flavor with 24 g of protein, but availability varies. ISO100 Pebbles Birthday Cake is another option with the same macros as Fruity Pebbles.
              </p>
